      "description": "First loop iteration: ares__expand_name_for_response parses the answer record name from the attacker-controlled DNS response buffer, allocating a heap buffer and storing the pointer in rr_name. This pointer becomes vulnerability-relevant when it is freed without being set to NULL, persisting as a dangling pointer into the next iteration."
