      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "a-root-null-reset",
      "fine_trace_step": 2,
      "description": "First free of rr_name at the end of the loop iteration without setting rr_name to NULL afterwards. The fix adds rr_name = NULL at the start of each iteration so that a failed ares__expand_name_for_response leaves rr_name as NULL rather than a dangling pointer."
    },
